        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: قرض گرفتن",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "قرض گرفتن (qarz gereftan) — \"to borrow\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "از دوستم کمی پول قرض گرفتم. az dustam kami pul qarz gereftam. I borrowed a little money from my friend."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Qarz \"loan\" + gereftan \"to take\" (stem gir-). Az kasi qarz gereftan — to borrow from someone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "قرض گرفتن (qarz gereftan) is literally \"to take a loan\": qarz was borrowed from Arabic qarḍ \"a loan\" (EtymDB), and gereftan \"to take\" is inherited Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
