            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او همه بدهیهایش را پرداخت. u hame-ye bedehihâyash râ pardâkht. He paid off all his debts."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From bedeh \"owing\", built on dâdan \"to give\", + -i."
            }
          ]
        },
