          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بدهی (bedehi) is native Persian, built on bedeh \"owing\", from deh-, the present stem of dâdan \"to give\", with the noun suffix -i: what you still have to give."
            }
          ]
        },
