            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "طلبکارها هر روز به او زنگ میزنند. talabkârhâ har ruz be u zang mizanand. His creditors call him every day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Talab \"claim\" + -kâr. Of a person who acts as if everyone owes him: talabkâr ast."
            }
